Andy,

You probably did not install the subset OSFDCMTEXT510, that's where all the
spell-stuff is hiding. The man-page is there because it's in the OSFMANOS510
subset.

So mount the distribution CD on /cdrom:
mount -r /dev/disk/cdrom0c /cdrom
and:
