Depends if you are used CDE/DTLogin or XDM as your
login manager.

If you are using CDE/DTLogin, edit /usr/dt/config/Xserverrs.con
to something like:

      :0   Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X :0 -su -bs -screen0 1280x1024

If you are using XDM, edit the file /var/X11/Xserver.conf
to contain at the end:
args <
         -pn
         -su
         -bs
         -once
         -screen0 1280x1024
 >

