The HSG80 provides LUN masking via "Selective Storage Presentation".  This
allows you to assign a LUN to a specific CONNECTION(s) on the controller.
This will solve your problem of both systems seeing the same LUN.

At the CLI you can do a SHOW CONNECTIONS

You should see the host connections for the 2 Tru64 systems on the fabric.
Assign the LUN to the specific server.  Check the SET command in the CLI
reference guide for the exact syntax to do this.




